An exact commodity exclusion leaves symbols that only contain the excluded text.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts 'Assets:*' --commodities '~EUR'

========== API ==========

investmentPerformance({ accounts: ['Assets:*'], commodities: ['~EUR'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity EUR
  default
  format 1,000.00 EUR
commodity EUROPA
  format 1,000 EUROPA
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 EUROPA 100 EUR
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  1 EUROPA {100 EUR}
  Assets:Cash  -100 EUR

========== OUTPUT ==========

Investment performance from 2024-01-01 to 2024-01-01
Instruments: 1
Opening value: 0.00 EUR
Net contributions: 100.00 EUR
Ending value: 100.00 EUR
Profit/loss: 0.00 EUR
Time-weighted return (total): 0.00 %
Time-weighted return (annualized): n/a
Money-weighted return (total): n/a
Money-weighted return (annualized): n/a

